# Internal packages

Do not add a new `packages/*` lib unless several apps need the same runtime code. Feature logic stays in `apps/api` / `apps/ui`.

## `@sidui/db`

- Tables live in `packages/db/schema/*.ts`, barrel-exported from `schema/index.ts`.
- `index.ts` exports `createClient` and re-exports `drizzle-orm` plus schema.
- API uses one app-level client: `apps/api/src/shared/util/db.ts` (`db`, query helpers, `isUniqueViolationError`). Do not construct extra Drizzle clients in repositories.
- Follow `db-schema-conventions.mdc` and `db-migrations.mdc`. Auth tables (`schema/auth.ts`) are Better Auth-owned — do not restyle them to match business tables.

## `@sidui/api-client`

- Thin Eden Treaty factory: `treaty<App>(baseUrl, { fetch: { credentials: 'include' } })`.
- `App` is `typeof server` from `@sidui/api` (`apps/api/src/index.ts`). Mount new route groups **before** `export type App`.
- UI calls `createApiClient` once in `apps/ui/src/lib/api-client.ts`. Never `fetch` REST paths by hand.
- Keep this package free of feature wrappers and React.
